   172	     writer exits non-zero, and readers serve the last completed day. Whether its reason was recorded is reported, not required;
   173	   - with a long read held, the writer commits;
   174	   - after the read ends, a checkpoint completes, and a reset brings the `-wal` within the limit;
   175	   - with a reader held across three completed days, the writer stops before the fourth with its reason recorded, and readers serve
